<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zephaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zephaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa, Ammon tapa Josiah damlai a, Kusi tapa, Gedaliah tapa, Amariah tapa, Hezekiah tapa, Zephaniah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leitung a thil om tengteng ka hihbei sipsip ding Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing leh sa ka hihbei ding; van a tungleng vasate, tuipi a ngasate, giloute toh kipalpuknate ka subei ding; leitung apan mihing ka satkhe ding hi” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Judah tung leh, Jerusalem a tengte tung ah ka khut ka lik ding; hiai mun a kipan in Baal omlaite leh milim biak ching siampute min ka satkhe ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Intung a van aksihon bia; Toupa kiang a kun a kichiam khin napi a, Milkom mai a kichiamte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa zuihna a kipan kilehheite, leh Toupa zong lou a, amah kanloute ka satkhe ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa Pathian ma ah dai sipsip in, Toupa ni lah a naita ngal a; Toupa’n lah kithoihna a bawlkhol khin a, a misapte a hih siangthou khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa kithoih ni’n hichi ahi ding, heutute, leh kumpipa tapate leh, gamdang puan a kizem huchibang tengteng ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in, phual kan a tawmte, hiamgamna leh khemna a a pu uh inn hihdimte, ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Ngasa kongpi apan kah thawmging a om dia, kongpi Nihna apan mauna leh tangte a kipan nakpitak a siatna husa a om ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mau un, nou Maktes a tengte, na sumsin mite tengteng a omta kei ua; dangka teh mite satkhiak ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in hichi a hi ding hi, khawnvak tawi in Jerusalem zong ding ka hi; mi uain dawn a tengden, a lungtang ua, Toupa’n thil hoih hi’n thil gilou leng a hih sam kei ding chi mite ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in a hauhna uh gallak a honghi dia, a innte uh a segawp ding; innte a lam ding ua, himahleh a luah kei ding uh; grephuante a bawl ding ua, himahleh huai a uain a dawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa ni thupi a nai a, a nai a, a kinoh mahmah, Toupa ni’n kah aw a thupi ding a; mi thilhihtheitakte huai ah a kap lawlawih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai ni thangpaihna ni ahi, lungzinna leh dahna ni, mialna leh lungkiakna ni, meipi leh khomial bikbek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pengkul leh gallauna ni, khopi daikaih siatna, a ning a insangte siat ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan mite tung ah dahna ka tun ding a, mittaw mite bang in a vak ding uhi, Toupa tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak un; huchi in a sisan uh leivui bang leh a sa uh eklei bang in butkhiak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa thangpaihna ni chiang in a dangka uhiam a dangkaeng uhiam in amaute a tan theikei ding; himahleh a mullitna mei in gam pumpi a kangbei ding a; hihbei a om ding a hih ziak in, beina mulkimhuai, gamsung a tengte tengteng tung ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ki kaikhawm un, ahi, ki kaikhawm un, zumna neilou namte aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thupiak a kuankhiak ma a, buhsi bang a hon mutmang ma in, na tung ua Toupa hehna kihtakhuai a hongtun ma in, na tung ua Toupa hehna ni a hong tunma in ki kaikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A vaihawmna zui, nou lei a mi nunnemte tengteng aw, Toupa zong un; diktatna zong un, migitna zong un; Toupa hehna ni ah sel in na omkha thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gaza lah nutsiat in a om dia, Askelon hihgawp in; suntang lai in Ashdod a hawlkhe ding ua, Ekron a ki zungkalh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi piau a teng Kereth namte aw na tung uh a gik hi, Toupa thu in noute hondem hi, Kanaan aw, Philistiate gam a teng omlou ding in k’on hihgawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in tuipi, piaute louhing noumun ahi ding a, belamchingte innte leh belamhonte a huangte ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai piau bel Judah inkaw omlaite ading ahi ding; huai ah a belamhonte uh a vak ding uh; nitaklam in Askelon innte ah a kual ding uh; Toupa a Pathian un amaute a veh in, sal a a tang uh pikhe nawn ding a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab hon kouna leh, Ammon tate gensiatna ka zata hi. A kigitpihte uh tung a kiliansak a, ka mite gam a dou a sawm uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian ka hin bang in, Chihtaktak in Moab, Sodom bang ahi ding a, Ammon tate Gomorrah bang, lou bineite leh chikhukte munsia suakden ding a, ka mi omlaite’n a lok ding ua, ka nam omlaite’n a maute a luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa mite tung a a kiletsak ua, a kou ziak un, a kisaktheihna ziak un sawi in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau tung ah Toupa a lauhuai ding a; lei pathiante tengteng kial in a hihbei chiang in michih in amau mun chiat leh namte tuikulh gam tengteng nangawn in amah a be ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou Ethiopiate leng, ka namsau a thah a om ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan aman mallam dou in a khut a likkhe ding hi: Assuria a hihse ding; Ninevi a kisegawp ding, huchi in gamdai bang in a keu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belamte a lai ah a kual ding ua, namte ganta tengteng; vangawngsau leh sakuh a chial tungnung ah a giak ding ua; tohlet ah a aw in la a sa ding uh; sangkilte ah siatgawpna a om ding; sidar sing a nasepte a hihsiat ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai khopi nuamsa pilvangloutak a teng a, a lungtang a keimah ka hi, kei lou kuamah dang a omkei; chi ahi; bangchidan a hong segawp a, gantate adia kualna ding hi ahia; kuapeuh a kiang a pai in a nuihsan in, a khut a leh khum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khopi nuaisiah, hihbuah leh nitsak a om tung a gik hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Aw a mangkei a, bawlhoihna leng a kipahpih kei; Toupa ah a muangkei a; a Pathian a naih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lak a a heutuliante humpinelkai humham bang ahi ua, a vaihawmmite nitaklam ngia a zingchiang a nekding nuse utlou bang ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zawlneite mizuau leh lepchiah ahi uh; A siampute un Mun Siangthou a hihbuah ua, dan tung ah a hiamgam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lak ua Toupa a diktat a; thulimlou ahihkei ding; zingsang teng in a vaihawm khovak ah a lak a, a vuaksuak ngeikei a; himahleh dikloute’n zum chih a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namte ka satkheta a, a insangte uh a kisegawp hi; a kongzingte uh ka susia a, kuamah a paikei uhi; a khopite uh hihsiat in a om a, huchi in mi a omkei ua a teng leng a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chihtaktak in kei n’on kihta ding ua, bawlhoihna na kipahpih ding, ka chi a; huchi in a tenna satkhiak in a omkei dia, amah tungtang a sehsa tengteng bang in; himahleh beltak in a thou ua a hih tengteng uh a sesak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in matding zuan a ka thohni a tun masiah hon nangak un Toupa’n a chi; namte kaihkhawm ka tup ahi ngal a, lalgamte ka suktuah a a tung ua ka hehna ka sunbuak theihna ding in, ka thangpaihna lauhuai tengteng; ka mullitna mei a lei tengteng nekgaih a om ding lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai hun chiang a mite’n Toupa min a loh ua, thukhatsat a amah na a septheihna ding un, a kiang uah muk siangthou ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ethiopia luite khenlam a kipan gimlim halmite, dalhsa ka mite tanu mahmah in ka thillat a hontawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in ka tung a na tatlekna, na thilhihte tengteng ziak in na zahlak kei ding; huai hun chiang a na lak a na mi kisathei leh kiuangsakte lakhe ding ka hih ziak in, huchi in ka tang siangthou ah na kiuangsak nawnta kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh na lak ah mi gimthuak leh genthei ka nuse ding a, Toupa ah a muang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel omsunte’n gilou ahihkei ding ua, zuau a gen sam kei ding uh; a kam uah leng lei khemhat a kimu kei ding hi; ne a, lum ding a, amaute kuamah in a hihlau louh ding ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lasa in, Aw Zion tanu; kikou in, aw Israel; Jerusalem tanu aw, na lungtang tengteng toh kipak in nuamsa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n na vaihawmnate a lamangta a, na melma a delhkhia a, na lak ah Israel kumpipa, Toupa ngei a om hi; gilou na lau nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in, Jerusalem kiang ah Lau ken, chih ahi ding; Aw Zion, na khutte ze awl sak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lak ah Toupa na Pathian a om hi, hondam ding mihat; na itna ah a khawl ding, lasa in na tung ah a nuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawmpi kulmut ziak a dahnate, noute adia puakgik leh gensiatna hite ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai in, huai hun chiang in, nang hihgimte tengteng ka bawl ding a, panpih kiphamohnu ka hondam ding a, hawlmang a omnu ka lakhawm ding; huchi in lei tengteng a a zahlakna uh a na omkhitnate ah, phatna leh minthanna amau ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in k’on lanawn ding a, huai hun chiang in nou k’on kaikhawm ding hi; na mitmuh ua na saltanna ua kipan a k’on pinawn chiang in, lei a mi tengteng lak ah min leh phatna in nou k’on bawl ding, Toupa’n a chita hi.
  </para>
</usx>
